**Filter by status:**
```
GET http://localhost:3000/events?page=1&limit=10&status=PUBLISHED
```

**Combine filters:**
```
GET http://localhost:3000/events?page=1&limit=10&category=CONCERT&status=PUBLISHED
```


**Test 2 — Cache Invalidation:**
```
1. GET /events           → cached response
2. POST /events          → create a new event
3. GET /events           → should show the new event (cache was invalidated)
```

## Step 9 — Protected Event Routes
```
POST http://localhost:3000/events
Authorization: Bearer ORGANIZER_TOKEN  ✅ should work
Authorization: Bearer ATTENDEE_TOKEN   ❌ should return 403
No token at all                        ❌ should return 401